1
00:00:00,637 --> 00:00:02,807
(Penny:)Sheldon, what took you so long?

2
00:00:02,806 --> 00:00:04,406
(Sheldon:)Wolowitz might
hand out cigars.

3
00:00:04,407 --> 00:00:06,077
(Sheldon:)I had to find my bubble gum

4
00:00:06,076 --> 00:00:09,546
(Sheldon:)cigar so I could join in
without looking foolish.

5
00:00:09,546 --> 00:00:11,716
(Leonard:)Damn, I need my inhaler.

6
00:00:11,715 --> 00:00:12,885
(Amy:)Just don't smoke.

7
00:00:12,882 --> 00:00:14,782
(Leonard:)No, I went down
the stairs too fast.

8
00:00:16,253 --> 00:00:17,683
(Sheldon:)Hey.

9
00:00:17,687 --> 00:00:19,757
(Raj:)Don't come to the hospital.
We're headed home.

10
00:00:19,756 --> 00:00:22,156
(Penny:)Oh, that was fast.
Did she sneeze the baby out?

11
00:00:22,158 --> 00:00:25,258
(Bernadette:)We showed up too early.
We'll keep you posted.

12
00:00:25,262 --> 00:00:26,862
(Penny:)Okay, well, we'll

13
00:00:26,863 --> 00:00:28,263
(Penny:)talk to you guys later. Bye.

14
00:00:28,265 --> 00:00:31,065
(Penny:)She said not to come.
It's gonna be a while.

15
00:00:31,067 --> 00:00:33,697
(Amy:)Well, first deliveries
can be slow.

16
00:00:33,703 --> 00:00:37,343
I am starting to rethink the
Flash onesie I bought this kid.

17
00:00:38,008 --> 00:00:40,278
(Leonard:)I found it,
but it's empty.

18
00:00:40,277 --> 00:00:42,277
(Penny:)Well, it doesn't matter. We're
not going to the hospital now.

19
00:00:42,279 --> 00:00:44,879
(Leonard:)Are you sure?
I'd really like to.

20
00:00:45,715 --> 00:00:49,185
(Amy:)Well, should we,
uh, head back up?

21
00:00:49,185 --> 00:00:51,355
Come on, guys.

22
00:00:51,354 --> 00:00:53,554
(Penny:)We're all awake. Why don't we go
to a diner or something?

23
00:00:53,556 --> 00:00:55,186
(Amy:)Oh, uh, I don't know.

24
00:00:55,191 --> 00:00:58,761
(Amy:)Sheldon, you don't want
to do that, do you?

